<title>INDIA: India to introduce new forex management act.</title>
<headline>India to introduce new forex management act.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India plans to introduce a bill for a new foreign exchange management law in parliament later this year, Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday.</p>
<p>A panel appointed by the Reserve Bank of India was due to complete drafting the bill shortly, he said.</p>
